  "description": "Grammar-driven synthetic corpus generator: mines nouns, verbs and adjectives and the syntax that joins them from real text with the rules of grammar, stores them in HoloDb, and recombines them into new grammatical sentences built only from words and pairings the text used, plus reading-comprehension Q&A pairs (single-sentence, multi-sentence passage, and two-turn). Rules-first (deterministic, zero-training) part-of-speech tagging, chunking and role assignment; mining fans out across cores through EvalApp (generation does too, opt-in); an optional mini-HoloFormer scorer re-ranks generated candidates by next-lemma likelihood once trained (POS tagging stays 100% rules-based).",
